<title>POLAND: HUTA OLAWA SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>HUTA OLAWA SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.25 vs   0.22</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.48 vs   0.47</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.46 vs   0.42</p>
<p> Sales		    4.61 vs   3.81</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.42 vs   2.34</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.23 vs   3.84</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.72 vs   3.56</p>
<p> Sales		   36.02 vs  30.66</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish non-ferrous metals smelter is</p>
<p>Huta Olawa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
